COMMENT ON TABLE app.distribution_check IS 'One AMO or TSO distribution check of a visited outlet.
owner: backend:sync | capture: OFFLINE | retention: transaction | pii: none';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.id IS 'Server surrogate key.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.client_uuid IS 'Client-generated UUID v4 of the record; the server upserts by it (idempotency key).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.family_uuid IS 'client_uuid of the family header the record belongs to (equal to client_uuid on a header).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.business_date IS 'Asia/Dhaka date of the trusted capture time.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.business_date_device IS 'Date on the phone''s own clock, kept when the server re-dated the row to a trusted business date.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.user_id IS 'Database id of the user who captured the record, taken from the token and never from the body.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.device_id IS 'Database id of the phone that captured the record, from the token.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.acting_for_user_id IS 'Assignee of the route when the capturing user worked it as a cover substitute.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.route_id IS 'Route (app.route) being worked.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.captured_at IS 'UTC instant of capture on the phone, from trusted time when an anchor exists.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.captured_elapsed_ms IS 'SystemClock.elapsedRealtime() at capture, in milliseconds since boot.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.boot_count IS 'Android boot counter at capture; with captured_elapsed_ms it anchors trusted time.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.clock_offset_ms IS 'Server time minus phone wall clock known at capture, in ms; null if the phone never synced.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.captured_offline IS 'True when the phone had no connection at capture.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.schema_version IS 'Version of the record payload schema.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.config_version IS 'Global config version in force for the row (at capture for device records).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.bundle_version IS 'Version of the day bundle the phone held at capture (<date>:<seq>).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.bundle_stale IS 'True when the record was captured on a cached bundle older than the business date.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.first_batch_uuid IS 'batch_uuid of the sync batch that first delivered the record.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.received_at IS 'UTC instant the server received the row.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.created_at IS 'UTC instant the row was inserted on the server.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.voided_at IS 'UTC time an admin data void tombstoned the row; the row is never deleted.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.external_ref IS 'Stable external reference for cross-walks with other systems (Apsis, ERP); unique when set.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.visit_client_uuid IS 'client_uuid of the visit the row belongs to.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.posm_present IS 'True when point-of-sale material was present at the outlet.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check.note IS 'Free-text note.';

