COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check_line.first_batch_uuid IS 'batch_uuid of the sync batch that first delivered the record.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check_line.received_at IS 'UTC instant the server received the row.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check_line.created_at IS 'UTC instant the row was inserted on the server.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app.distribution_check_line.voided_at IS 'UTC time an admin data void tombstoned the row; the row is never deleted.';
